{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cuv","name":"新標點和合本","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89t","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89t","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CUV","englishName":"Chinese Union Version (traditional)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"923f114ccc6ab7fc558e054f84df5214fa9782ca7c02882cf173417a0d1d641e","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31021,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"MAL","translationId":"cmn_cuv","name":"瑪拉基書","commonName":"瑪拉基書","title":"瑪拉基書","order":39,"numberOfChapters":4,"sha256":"3716f120cdb0dc26427748baccd99be95d56752b523a0c5a454b0172a2dff768","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/MAL/1.json","lastChapterNumber":4,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/MAL/4.json","totalNumberOfVerses":55},"chapter":{"number":4,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["耶和華的日子臨近"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["萬軍之耶和華說：「那日臨近，勢如燒着的火爐，凡狂傲的和行惡的必如碎稭，在那日必被燒盡，根本枝條一無存留。"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["但向你們敬畏我名的人必有公義的日頭出現，其光線",{"noteId":4},"有醫治之能。你們必出來跳躍如圈裏的肥犢。"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["你們必踐踏惡人；在我所定的日子，他們必如灰塵在你們腳掌之下。這是萬軍之耶和華說的。"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["「你們當記念我僕人摩西的律法，就是我在何烈山為以色列眾人所吩咐他的律例典章。"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["「看哪，耶和華大而可畏之日未到以前，我必差遣先知以利亞到你們那裏去。"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["他必使父親的心轉向兒女，兒女的心轉向父親，免得我來咒詛遍地。」"]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":4,"caller":"-","text":"原文是翅膀","reference":{"chapter":4,"verse":2}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/MAL/4.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/MAT/1.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/MAL/3.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":6}